<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for getting in touch with the Qantas Customer Care team regarding your flight from {{{Case.Departure_City__c}}} to{{{Case.Arrival_City__c}}} on {{{Case.Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}}}.<br />
<br />
I’m sorry to hear that you were disappointed with the inflight entertainment options onboard this flight.<br />
<br />
<strong>Checking which aircraft has inflight entertainment</strong><br />
<br />
We’ve fitted selected domestic and all international flights with inflight entertainment, allowing customers to stream directly from their seat from the moment they step on board.<br />
<br />
When booking via qantas.com you can see which aircraft is scheduled to operate each flight by clicking on the red flight number. This may assist you in deciding which flight best suits your needs.<br />
<br />
<strong>Watching inflight entertainment on your own device</strong><br />
<br />
To stream entertainment on your next domestic flight directly to your smartphone or tablet, you'll need the latest Qantas Entertainment App installed on your device.<br />
<br />
This is available to download for free from the Apple App Store or Google Play store.<br />
<br />
We recommend that you download and install the app before your flight, as there’s no internet connection on board. Accessing inflight entertainment with your own device is limited to certain aircraft types.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with exceptional service from start to finish.<br />
<br />
I’d like to assure you that your comments have been passed onto our Inflight Product and Service Development team for review.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to tell us about your experience — I hope we can make you more comfortable next time you fly with us.</p>
</body>
</html>